Vita: measurement only (the main-thread profile, platform/vita/runtime/actor_profile.cpp). J3DModel's
calc, calcMaterial, diff, entry and viewCalc each open a scope that the port times on sampled frames
(one frame in eight, full receipts only), so the receipts can split model work into joint/animation
matrices (calc) and the parts that only prepare the picture. Outside sampled frames each part pays
one flag test. No game behaviour changes: same calls, same order, same results.

--- a/libs/JSystem/src/J3DGraphAnimator/J3DModel.cpp
+++ b/libs/JSystem/src/J3DGraphAnimator/J3DModel.cpp
@@ -15,6 +15,29 @@
 #include "dusk/interp/vertex.h"
